                        


Item #:  SCP-5461

Object Class:  Safe

Special Containment Procedures:  SCP-5461-1 is to be contained inside a Storage Locker inside Site-76. All Instances of SCP-5461-2 are to be terminated if they are the following colors: Red, Purple, Indigo, Lime.

Description:  SCP-5461-1 is a small plastic bag, of the variety usually used in candy stores to put self-served candy inside. Written on the  of the bag in Sharpietm brand marker is the incription, 'yumy gummie bear by dado'. SCP-5461-1 holds a small amount of gummy bears, which are classified SCP-5461-2. SCP-5461-2 are mildly sapient, and possess different amounts of sentience,depending on their color. they are also capable of giving artificial feelings to those who consume. The following color categories are


Color of SCP-5462-1
