Extremely effusive. Sentience of a 3-year-old child.
To be given limited privileges and eaten after two weeks. subjects who eat describe a feeling of  and the taste of lemon.


Lime 'sour bar'
Dour and annoyed. sentience of a 23-year-old adult, with chauvinistic views.
To be terminated immediately. subjects who try describe a feeling of  and the taste of lime.


Blue 'cool bear'
Only instance wearing an article of clothing (glasses.) will walk around and attract other instances. Sentience of a 9-year-old child.
To be given limited privileges, and killed after 3 days. subjects who eat describe feelings of  and the taste of blueberry.


Indigo 'odd bear'
Tries to eat other instances.
To be Terminated immediately. Subjects who eat describe the feeling of  along with the taste of poppy seeds. It is unknown why this taste is the one chosen.


Purple 'yucky bear'
Disgusted, with an air of superiority. Sentience equivalent to a 15-year-old child.
To be terminated immediately. subjects who eat describe a feeling of  along with the taste of [DATA EXPUNGED]


Brown 'dark bear'
Dark, broody. Keeps to itself.
To be given limited privileges and eaten after 5 hours. Subjects describe a feeling of  and note the taste of Cocoa.


Clear 'brightie beear'
Smart, large knowledge of the foundation.
To be turned into Junior Researchers for the foundation. If eaten, subject will [DATA EXPUNGED], leaving large amount of flyers for 'dado's gumy bears' all over the Testing Chamber's floor.



